<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Branche Simple</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f0f2f5;
            color: #333;
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .header-branche {
            background: #4a90e2;
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .badge {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .section {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #4a90e2;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 10px 5px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            background: #357ae8;
        }
        
        .btn-retour {
            background: #95a5a6;
        }
        
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="header-branche">
        <div class="badge">BRANCHE SECONDAIRE</div>
        <h1>Version Simplifiée</h1>
        <p>Une branche simple pour des modifications rapides</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="section">
            <h2>📋 Fonctionnalités</h2>
            <p>Cette branche contient des modifications simples.</p>
            <ul style="margin: 15px 0 15px 20px;">
                <li>Design épuré</li>
                <li>Code minimal</li>
                <li>Facile à modifier</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>⚡ Actions Rapides</h2>
            <p>Testez rapidement cette version :</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                <button class="btn" onclick="montrerMessage()">Tester</button>
                <a href="../index.html" class="btn btn-retour">Retour principal</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>Branche secondaire • Version légère</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function montrerMessage() {
            alert("✅ Branche secondaire active !");
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
    
    